yside and we're dedicated to  getting weapons off the streets  silence is never an option  we need people to take a stand against  criminals  we need you to speak to us so that we  can take action  let us know who is carrying and storing  weapons and let us do the rest  we know that the answers to this lie  within our communities so my appeal to  you is please tell us what you know and  help us get Justice for Ellie's family  particularly we want information about  the whereabouts of a dark colored  Mercedes that was in the lighthouse  public house  um car park before the incident we want  to know where it came from and where  it's gone since then  information but you don't want to speak  to a police officer directly please  contact us via Crime Stoppers  thank you  talking
 

